      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦、哦哦！？……真有趣～！\n好厉害！我从来没吃过\n这种味道的料理！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e4d535fa42d73be41269fcf9f3f52bae7a26e2b747967b8884b26d6f8ed2249",
